Ta>a​Ta−1.T_{a}>a\,T_{a-1}.
For a≤2a\leq 2, Lemma 3.14 does not hold. However, we can manually solve System 3.6 for a=1, 2a=1,\,2 to find the minimal solution fi=1f_{i}=1 for all ii. Thus, we set T1=T2=1T_{1}=T_{2}=1. For a≥3a\geq 3, we have the above inequality.
